n":"vehicle length","shape":"photo:honda-s2000","measure":"4.135 m · vehicle length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.33010883,"explanation":"Adult male giraffe: 5.5 m (upper adult height). Honda S2000: 4.135 m (vehicle length). Ratio: 1.33×.\nAn adult male can reach about 5.5 m tall. Individuals and poses vary.\n2005 S2000 overall length: 4.135 m.","sources":["https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/giraffe","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honda_S2000","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Giraffa.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:HondaS2000-004.png"]}]'::jsonb);
