dth). Climbing hammer: 0.3 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 0.62×.\nThe Nomad is approximately 18.5 cm wide.\nA 30 cm hand-tool reference.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genesis_Nomad","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Climbing_hammer.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sega-Nomad-Front_(rotated).png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Climbing_hammer.png"]}]'::jsonb);
