nce handlebar height). Atari Portfolio: 0.2 m (computer width). Ratio: 5.00×.\nA one-metre handlebar-height reference. Adjustable scooters can be set lower.\nThe pocket computer is about 20 cm wide.","sources":["https://www.stigasports.com/","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atari_Portfolio","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stiga_Route_200_S.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Atari-Portfolio-Computer.png"]}]'::jsonb);
