ne height","shape":"photo:iphone3g"},"reference":{"name":"Land tortoise","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:tortoise","measure":"30 cm · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.385,"explanation":"iPhone 3G: 0.1155 m (phone height). Land tortoise: 0.3 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 0.39×.\niPhone 3G height: 115.5 mm.\nA 30 cm overall-length reference including the head and legs. Species and poses vary.","sources":["https://devimages.apple.com/programs/ipod/dimensions/iPhone-3G-dimensions.pdf","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Tortoise.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:IPhone_3G.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Tortoise.png"]}]'::jsonb);
