sketball"},"reference":{"name":"2010 Mac mini","dimension":"enclosure width","shape":"photo:mac-mini","measure":"19.7 cm · enclosure width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.21319797,"explanation":"Size-7 basketball: 0.239 m (nominal diameter). 2010 Mac mini: 0.197 m (enclosure width). Ratio: 1.21×.\nA nominal diameter of 23.9 cm, corresponding to about 75 cm circumference.\nThis Mac mini generation has a 19.7 cm square footprint.","sources":["https://www.fiba.basketball/en/official-basketball-rules","https://support.apple.com/en-us/112588","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Isolated_basketball.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mac_mini_server.png"]}]'::jsonb);
