":"photo:peacock-butterfly","measure":"6.5 cm · reference wingspan"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":2.61538462,"explanation":"Wire stripper: 0.17 m (reference overall length). Peacock butterfly: 0.065 m (reference wingspan). Ratio: 2.62×.\nA 17 cm hand-tool reference. The photograph supplies the outline, not a scale calibration.\nA 65 mm wingspan reference with the wings spread.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wire_stripper.png","https://butterfly-conservation.org/butterflies/peacock","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wire_stripper.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aglais_io_-_3150.png"]}]'::jsonb);
