dy width). Land tortoise: 0.3 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 0.38×.\nE-PL1 body width: 114.6 mm.\nA 30 cm overall-length reference including the head and legs. Species and poses vary.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olympus_PEN_E-PL1","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Tortoise.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Olympus_E-PL1.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Tortoise.png"]}]'::jsonb);
