erence overall height). Dreamcast VMU: 0.08 m (unit height). Ratio: 2.50×.\nA 20 cm broccoli reference including its stalk.\nThe Visual Memory Unit is about 80 mm high.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Broccoli.png","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VMU","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Broccoli.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sega-Dreamcast-VMU.png"]}]'::jsonb);
