ension":"reference front width","shape":"photo:sunglasses"},"reference":{"name":"Land tortoise","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:tortoise","measure":"30 cm · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.46666667,"explanation":"Sunglasses: 0.14 m (reference front width). Land tortoise: 0.3 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 0.47×.\nA 14 cm front-width reference, not the length of the folding arms.\nA 30 cm overall-length reference including the head and legs. Species and poses vary.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunglasses-1_retouch.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Tortoise.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunglasses-1_retouch.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Tortoise.png"]}]'::jsonb);
