":{"name":"Commodore 128","dimension":"keyboard-computer width","shape":"photo:keyboard"},"reference":{"name":"Adult male giraffe","dimension":"upper adult height","shape":"photo:giraffe","measure":"5.5 m · upper adult height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.07818182,"explanation":"Commodore 128: 0.43 m (keyboard-computer width). Adult male giraffe: 5.5 m (upper adult height). Ratio: 0.08×.\nA 43 cm wide keyboard-computer reference.\nAn adult male can reach about 5.5 m tall. Individuals and poses vary.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commodore_128","https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/giraffe","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Commodore-128.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Giraffa.png"]}]'::jsonb);
