nit height). Size-7 basketball: 0.239 m (nominal diameter). Ratio: 0.33×.\nThe Visual Memory Unit is about 80 mm high.\nA nominal diameter of 23.9 cm, corresponding to about 75 cm circumference.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VMU","https://www.fiba.basketball/en/official-basketball-rules","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sega-Dreamcast-VMU.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Isolated_basketball.png"]}]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO ledger_private.trivia_packs(game,slot,version,questions) VALUES('how-much-ish',56,7,'[{"id":"photo-size-v7-381","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the sunglasses to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Sunglasses","dimension":"reference front width","shape":"photo:sunglasses"},"reference":{"name":"Game Boy Color","dimension":"console height","shape":"photo:gameboy-color","measure":"13.35 cm · console height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.04868914,"explanation":"Sunglasses: 0.14 m (reference front width). Game Boy Color: 0.1335 m (console height). Ratio: 1.05×.\nA 14 cm front-width reference, not the length of the folding arms.\nThe Game Boy Color is 133.5 mm high.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunglasses-1_retouch.png","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Game_Boy_Color","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunglasses-1_retouch.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo-Game-Boy-Color-FL.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-382","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the full-size violin to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Full-size violin","dimension":"typical overall length","shape":"photo:violin"},"reference":{"name":"Honda S2000","dimension":"vehicle length","shape":"photo:honda-s2000","measure":"4.135 m · vehicle length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.1426844,"explanation":"Full-size violin: 0.59 m (typical overall length). Honda S2000: 4.135 m (vehicle length). Ratio: 0.14×.\nA full-size violin is about 59 cm overall. The bow is excluded.\n2005 S2000 overall length: 4.135 m.","sources":["https://www.yamaha.com/en/musical_instrument_guide/violin/structure/","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honda_S2000","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Violin_VL100_(cropped).png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:HondaS2000-004.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-383","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the tennis ball to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Tennis ball","dimension":"reference ball diameter","shape":"photo:tennis-ball"},"reference":{"name":"Game Boy Advance SP","dimension":"console width","shape":"photo:gba-sp","measure":"8.46 cm · console width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.79196217,"explanation":"Tennis ball: 0.067 m (reference ball diameter). Game Boy Advance SP: 0.0846 m (console width). Ratio: 0.79×.\nA 6.7 cm diameter reference, within the standard ball-size range.\nThe SP is 84.6 mm wide, whether open or closed.","sources":["https://www.itftennis.com/en/about-us/tennis-tech/approved-balls/","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Game_Boy_Advance_SP","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tennisball2.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Game-Boy-Advance-SP-Mk2.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-384","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the small scissors to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Small scissors","dimension":"reference end-to-end length","shape":"photo:scissors"},"reference":{"name":"iPhone 3G","dimension":"phone height","shape":"photo:iphone3g","measure":"11.55 cm · phone height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.21212121,"explanation":"Small scissors: 0.14 m (reference end-to-end length). iPhone 3G: 0.1155 m (phone height). Ratio: 1.21×.\nA 14 cm household-scissors reference, measured from handle end to blade tip.\niPhone 3G height: 115.5 mm.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_pair_of_blue_scissors.png","https://devimages.apple.com/programs/ipod/dimensions/iPhone-3G-dimensions.pdf","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_pair_of_blue_scissors.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:IPhone_3G.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-385","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the 2010 mac mini to match its real size.","target":{"name":"2010 Mac mini","dimension":"enclosure width","shape":"photo:mac-mini"},"reference":{"name":"Broccoli head","dimension":"reference overall height","shape":"photo:broccoli","measure":"20 cm · reference overall height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.985,"explanation":"2010 Mac mini: 0.197 m (enclosure width). Broccoli head: 0.2 m (reference overall height). Ratio: 0.98×.\nThis Mac mini generation has a 19.7 cm square footprint.\nA 20 cm broccoli reference including its stalk.","sources":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/112588","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Broccoli.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mac_mini_server.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Broccoli.png"]}]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO ledger_private.trivia_packs(game,slot,version,questions) VALUES('how-much-ish',57,7,'[{"id":"photo-size-v7-386","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the open umbrella to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Open umbrella","dimension":"reference canopy width","shape":"photo:umbrella"},"reference":{"name":"Road roller","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:road-roller","measure":"5 m · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.2,"explanation":"Open umbrella: 1 m (reference canopy width). Road roller: 5 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 0.20×.\nA one-metre canopy-width reference. Umbrella models vary.\nA five-metre road-roller reference; construction machines come in many sizes.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Umbrella.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Road_roller.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Umbrella.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Road_roller.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-387","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the drywall screw to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Drywall screw","dimension":"reference screw length","shape":"photo:screw"},"reference":{"name":"Media remote control","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:remote","measure":"14.5 cm · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.24137931,"explanation":"Drywall screw: 0.035 m (reference screw length). Media remote control: 0.145 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 0.24×.\nA 35 mm drywall-screw reference; this is one selected size, not a universal screw length.\nA 14.5 cm reference remote, measured end to end.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Drywall_screw.png","https://www.playstation.com/en-us/accessories/media-remote/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Drywall_screw.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PlayStation_5_Media_Remote_-_front.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-388","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resi