g-axis length). Ratio: 2.50×.\nThe memory card is 25 mm wide and 20 mm high.\nA 10 mm roasted-coffee-bean reference.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XD-Picture_Card","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coffee_bean_transparent.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:XD_card_16M_Fujifilm_front.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coffee_bean_transparent.png"]}]'::jsonb);
