m · enclosure width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":4.56852792,"explanation":"F tuba: 0.9 m (reference standing height). 2010 Mac mini: 0.197 m (enclosure width). Ratio: 4.57×.\nA 90 cm standing-height reference. Tubas vary substantially by pitch and design.\nThis Mac mini generation has a 19.7 cm square footprint.","sources":["https://www.yamaha.com/en/musical_instrument_guide/tuba/structure/","https://support.apple.com/en-us/112588","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Viennese_six-valve_bass_tuba_in_F(made_by_Jungwirth)_Transparent.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mac_mini_server.png"]}]'::jsonb);
