","dimension":"unit height","shape":"photo:dreamcast-vmu"},"reference":{"name":"Open umbrella","dimension":"reference canopy width","shape":"photo:umbrella","measure":"1 m · reference canopy width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.08,"explanation":"Dreamcast VMU: 0.08 m (unit height). Open umbrella: 1 m (reference canopy width). Ratio: 0.08×.\nThe Visual Memory Unit is about 80 mm high.\nA one-metre canopy-width reference. Umbrella models vary.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VMU","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Umbrella.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sega-Dreamcast-VMU.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Umbrella.png"]}]'::jsonb);
