nce overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.445,"explanation":"Game Boy Advance: 0.1445 m (console width). Disposable razor: 0.1 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 1.44×.\nOriginal model: 144.5 mm wide; cartridges are excluded from the width.\nA 10 cm razor reference, measured end to end.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Game_Boy_Advance","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Razor.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:GameBoyAdvance-transparent.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Razor.png"]}]'::jsonb);
