,"shape":"photo:zebra"},"reference":{"name":"Wire stripper","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:wire-stripper","measure":"17 cm · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":14.11764706,"explanation":"Plains zebra: 2.4 m (reference head-and-body length). Wire stripper: 0.17 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 14.12×.\nA 2.4 m head-and-body reference; the tail is not part of this measurement.\nA 17 cm hand-tool reference. The photograph supplies the outline, not a scale calibration.","sources":["https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/zebra","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wire_stripper.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Zebra.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wire_stripper.png"]}]'::jsonb);
