idth). Billiard chalk cube: 0.025 m (reference cube width). Ratio: 4.92×.\nA 123 mm controller body reference; the cable is excluded.\nA 2.5 cm chalk-cube reference.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nintendo_Entertainment_System","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Billiard_chalk_20050724.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo-Entertainment-System-NES-Controller-FL.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Billiard_chalk_20050724.png"]}]'::jsonb);
