on":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:road-roller","measure":"5 m · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.06,"explanation":"Climbing hammer: 0.3 m (reference overall length). Road roller: 5 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 0.06×.\nA 30 cm hand-tool reference.\nA five-metre road-roller reference; construction machines come in many sizes.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Climbing_hammer.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Road_roller.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Climbing_hammer.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Road_roller.png"]}]'::jsonb);
