:"reference head-and-body length","shape":"photo:badger"},"reference":{"name":"iPhone 3G","dimension":"phone height","shape":"photo:iphone3g","measure":"11.55 cm · phone height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":6.49350649,"explanation":"European badger: 0.75 m (reference head-and-body length). iPhone 3G: 0.1155 m (phone height). Ratio: 6.49×.\nA 75 cm adult reference, excluding the tail. Adults vary in size.\niPhone 3G height: 115.5 mm.","sources":["https://www.woodlandtrust.org.uk/trees-woods-and-wildlife/animals/mammals/badger/","https://devimages.apple.com/programs/ipod/dimensions/iPhone-3G-dimensions.pdf","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Badger.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:IPhone_3G.png"]}]'::jsonb);
