vocado","measure":"14 cm · reference fruit length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.81857143,"explanation":"Olympus E-PL1: 0.1146 m (camera body width). Avocado: 0.14 m (reference fruit length). Ratio: 0.82×.\nE-PL1 body width: 114.6 mm.\nA 14 cm reference avocado. Fruit sizes vary considerably.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olympus_PEN_E-PL1","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Avocado.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Olympus_E-PL1.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Avocado.png"]}]'::jsonb);
