ize the nikon d90 to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Nikon D90","dimension":"camera body width","shape":"photo:nikon-d90"},"reference":{"name":"Billiard chalk cube","dimension":"reference cube width","shape":"photo:chalk","measure":"2.5 cm · reference cube width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":5.28,"explanation":"Nikon D90: 0.132 m (camera body width). Billiard chalk cube: 0.025 m (reference cube width). Ratio: 5.28×.\nD90 body width: 132 mm. Lens and strap are not part of the width measurement.\nA 2.5 cm chalk-cube reference.","sources":["https://www.nikon.com/company/news/2008/0827_d90_01/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Billiard_chalk_20050724.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nikon_D90.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Billiard_chalk_20050724.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-624","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the sewing needle to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Sewing needle","dimension":"reference end-to-end length","shape":"photo:needle"},"reference":{"name":"xD-Picture Card","dimension":"card width","shape":"photo:xd-card","measure":"2.5 cm · card width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.6,"explanation":"Sewing needle: 0.04 m (reference end-to-end length). xD-Picture Card: 0.025 m (card width). Ratio: 1.60×.\nA 4 cm reference needle. Sewing needles come in multiple lengths.\nThe memory card is 25 mm wide and 20 mm high.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sewing_needle.png","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XD-Picture_Card","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sewing_needle.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:XD_card_16M_Fujifilm_front.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-625","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the size-7 basketball to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Size-7 basketball","dimension":"nominal diameter","shape":"photo:basketball"},"reference":{"name":"Honda S2000","dimension":"vehicle length","shape":"photo:honda-s2000","measure":"4.135 m · vehicle length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.05779927,"explanation":"Size-7 basketball: 0.239 m (nominal diameter). Honda S2000: 4.135 m (vehicle length). Ratio: 0.06×.\nA nominal diameter of 23.9 cm, corresponding to about 75 cm circumference.\n2005 S2000 overall length: 4.135 m.","sources":["https://www.fiba.basketball/en/official-basketball-rules","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honda_S2000","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Isolated_basketball.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:HondaS2000-004.png"]}]'::jsonb);
