-to-end length). xD-Picture Card: 0.025 m (card width). Ratio: 5.60×.\nA 14 cm household-scissors reference, measured from handle end to blade tip.\nThe memory card is 25 mm wide and 20 mm high.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_pair_of_blue_scissors.png","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XD-Picture_Card","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_pair_of_blue_scissors.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:XD_card_16M_Fujifilm_front.png"]}]'::jsonb);
