ce fruit length","shape":"photo:avocado","measure":"14 cm · reference fruit length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.70714286,"explanation":"Nintendo Switch: 0.239 m (width with Joy-Con). Avocado: 0.14 m (reference fruit length). Ratio: 1.71×.\nOriginal Nintendo Switch: 239 mm wide with Joy-Con attached.\nA 14 cm reference avocado. Fruit sizes vary considerably.","sources":["https://www.nintendo.com/us/gaming-systems/switch/tech-specs/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Avocado.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo-Switch-wJoyCons-BlRd-Standing-FL.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Avocado.png"]}]'::jsonb);
