 recorder to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Soprano recorder","dimension":"reference length","shape":"photo:recorder"},"reference":{"name":"DualShock 2 controller","dimension":"reference controller width","shape":"photo:controller","measure":"15.7 cm · reference controller width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":2.03821656,"explanation":"Soprano recorder: 0.32 m (reference length). DualShock 2 controller: 0.157 m (reference controller width). Ratio: 2.04×.\nA 32 cm soprano recorder reference; recorders come in many sizes.\nA 15.7 cm controller-body width reference, excluding the cable.","sources":["https://www.yamaha.com/en/musical_instrument_guide/recorder/structure/","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DualShock","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yamaha_Soprano_Recorder_YRS-61.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PlayStation2-DualShock2.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-709","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the nikon d90 to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Nikon D90","dimension":"camera body width","shape":"photo:nikon-d90"},"reference":{"name":"Full-size electric guitar","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:guitar","measure":"1 m · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.132,"explanation":"Nikon D90: 0.132 m (camera body width). Full-size electric guitar: 1 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 0.13×.\nD90 body width: 132 mm. Lens and strap are not part of the width measurement.\nA one-metre reference guitar. Overall length varies by model; this is not its string scale length.","sources":["https://www.nikon.com/company/news/2008/0827_d90_01/","https://www.fender.com/articles/instruments/what-is-scale-length","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nikon_D90.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guitar_3.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-710","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the 2010 mac mini to match its real size.","target":{"name":"2010 Mac mini","dimension":"enclosure width","shape":"photo:mac-mini"},"reference":{"name":"Disposable razor","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:razor","measure":"10 cm · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.97,"explanation":"2010 Mac mini: 0.197 m (enclosure width). Disposable razor: 0.1 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 1.97×.\nThis Mac mini generation has a 19.7 cm square footprint.\nA 10 cm razor reference, measured end to end.","sources":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/112588","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Razor.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mac_mini_server.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Razor.png"]}]'::jsonb);
