atch its real size.","target":{"name":"Small scissors","dimension":"reference end-to-end length","shape":"photo:scissors"},"reference":{"name":"Nintendo Switch","dimension":"width with Joy-Con","shape":"photo:switch","measure":"23.9 cm · width with Joy-Con"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.58577406,"explanation":"Small scissors: 0.14 m (reference end-to-end length). Nintendo Switch: 0.239 m (width with Joy-Con). Ratio: 0.59×.\nA 14 cm household-scissors reference, measured from handle end to blade tip.\nOriginal Nintendo Switch: 239 mm wide with Joy-Con attached.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_pair_of_blue_scissors.png","https://www.nintendo.com/us/gaming-systems/switch/tech-specs/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_pair_of_blue_scissors.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo-Switch-wJoyCons-BlRd-Standing-FL.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-754","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the land tortoise to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Land tortoise","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:tortoise"},"reference":{"name":"AKG C214 microphone","dimension":"microphone height","shape":"photo:akg-microphone","measure":"16 cm · microphone height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.875,"explanation":"Land tortoise: 0.3 m (reference overall length). AKG C214 microphone: 0.16 m (microphone height). Ratio: 1.88×.\nA 30 cm overall-length reference including the head and legs. Species and poses vary.\nC214 microphone height: 160 mm, without a stand.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Tortoise.png","https://www.akg.com/Microphones/Condenser%20Microphones/C214.html","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Tortoise.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AKG_C214_Condenser_microphone.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-755","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the full-size violin to match its real size.","targ