(nominal diameter). Original Nintendo DS: 0.1487 m (console width). Ratio: 1.61×.\nA nominal diameter of 23.9 cm, corresponding to about 75 cm circumference.\nOriginal DS width: 148.7 mm.","sources":["https://www.fiba.basketball/en/official-basketball-rules","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nintendo_DS","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Isolated_basketball.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo-DS-Fat-Blue.png"]}]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO ledger_private.trivia_packs(game,slot,version,questions) VALUES('how-much-ish',137,7,'[{"id":"photo-size-v7-786","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the soprano recorder to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Soprano recorder","dimension":"reference length","shape":"photo:recorder"},"reference":{"name":"AKG C214 microphone","dimension":"microphone height","shape":"photo:akg-microphone","measure":"16 cm · microphone height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":2,"explanation":"Soprano recorder: 0.32 m (reference length). AKG C214 microphone: 0.16 m (microphone height). Ratio: 2.00×.\nA 32 cm soprano recorder reference; recorders come in many sizes.\nC214 microphone height: 160 mm, without a stand.","sources":["https://www.yamaha.com/en/musical_instrument_guide/recorder/structure/","https://www.akg.com/Microphones/Condenser%20Microphones/C214.html","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yamaha_Soprano_Recorder_YRS-61.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AKG_C214_Condenser_microphone.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-787","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the sunglasses to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Sunglasses","dimension":"reference front width","shape":"photo:sunglasses"},"reference":{"name":"Game Boy Micro","dimension":"console width","shape":"photo:gameboy-micro","measure":"10.1 cm · console width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.38613861,"explanation":"Sunglasses: 0.14 m (reference front width). Game Boy Micro: 0.101 m (console width). Ratio: 1.39×.\nA 14 cm front-width reference, not the length of the folding arms.\nThe Micro is 101 mm wide.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunglasses-1_retouch.png","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Game_Boy_Micro","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunglasses-1_retouch.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Game-Boy-Micro.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-788","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the full-size electric guitar to match its real size.","targ