 0.67 m (typical assembled length). iPhone 3G: 0.1155 m (phone height). Ratio: 5.80×.\nA reference concert flute about 67 cm long; model and footjoint affect length.\niPhone 3G height: 115.5 mm.","sources":["https://www.yamaha.com/en/musical_instrument_guide/flute/structure/","https://devimages.apple.com/programs/ipod/dimensions/iPhone-3G-dimensions.pdf","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yamaha_Flute_YFL-874W.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:IPhone_3G.png"]}]'::jsonb);
