hoto:switch","measure":"23.9 cm · width with Joy-Con"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.28033473,"explanation":"Tennis ball: 0.067 m (reference ball diameter). Nintendo Switch: 0.239 m (width with Joy-Con). Ratio: 0.28×.\nA 6.7 cm diameter reference, within the standard ball-size range.\nOriginal Nintendo Switch: 239 mm wide with Joy-Con attached.","sources":["https://www.itftennis.com/en/about-us/tennis-tech/approved-balls/","https://www.nintendo.com/us/gaming-systems/switch/tech-specs/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tennisball2.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo-Switch-wJoyCons-BlRd-Standing-FL.png"]}]'::jsonb);
