 match its real size.","target":{"name":"Nintendo Switch","dimension":"width with Joy-Con","shape":"photo:switch"},"reference":{"name":"Kick scooter","dimension":"reference handlebar height","shape":"photo:skateboard","measure":"1 m · reference handlebar height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.239,"explanation":"Nintendo Switch: 0.239 m (width with Joy-Con). Kick scooter: 1 m (reference handlebar height). Ratio: 0.24×.\nOriginal Nintendo Switch: 239 mm wide with Joy-Con attached.\nA one-metre handlebar-height reference. Adjustable scooters can be set lower.","sources":["https://www.nintendo.com/us/gaming-systems/switch/tech-specs/","https://www.stigasports.com/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo-Switch-wJoyCons-BlRd-Standing-FL.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stiga_Route_200_S.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-839","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the sega nomad to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Sega Nomad","dimension":"console width","shape":"photo:sega-nomad"},"reference":{"name":"Open umbrella","dimension":"reference canopy width","shape":"photo:umbrella","measure":"1 m · reference canopy width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.185,"explanation":"Sega Nomad: 0.185 m (console width). Open umbrella: 1 m (reference canopy width). Ratio: 0.18×.\nThe Nomad is approximately 18.5 cm wide.\nA one-metre canopy-width reference. Umbrella models vary.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genesis_Nomad","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Umbrella.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sega-Nomad-Front_(rotated).png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Umbrella.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-840","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the concert flute to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Concert flute","dimension":"typical assembled length","shape":"photo:flute"},"reference":{"name":"BlackBerry Q10","dimension":"phone height","shape":"photo:blackberry","measure":"11.96 cm · phone height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":5.60200669,"explanation":"Concert flute: 0.67 m (typical assembled length). BlackBerry Q10: 0.1196 m (phone height). Ratio: 5.60×.\nA reference concert flute about 67 cm long; model and footjoint affect length.\nBlackBerry Q10 height: 119.6 mm.","sources":["https://www.yamaha.com/en/musical_instrument_guide/flute/structure/","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BlackBerry_Q10","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yamaha_Flute_YFL-874W.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Blackberry-Q10-transparent.png"]}]'::jsonb);
