ast VMU: 0.08 m (unit height). Ratio: 8.38×.\nA reference concert flute about 67 cm long; model and footjoint affect length.\nThe Visual Memory Unit is about 80 mm high.","sources":["https://www.yamaha.com/en/musical_instrument_guide/flute/structure/","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VMU","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yamaha_Flute_YFL-874W.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sega-Dreamcast-VMU.png"]}]'::jsonb);
