shape":"photo:guitar","measure":"1 m · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.239,"explanation":"Nintendo Switch: 0.239 m (width with Joy-Con). Full-size electric guitar: 1 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 0.24×.\nOriginal Nintendo Switch: 239 mm wide with Joy-Con attached.\nA one-metre reference guitar. Overall length varies by model; this is not its string scale length.","sources":["https://www.nintendo.com/us/gaming-systems/switch/tech-specs/","https://www.fender.com/articles/instruments/what-is-scale-length","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo-Switch-wJoyCons-BlRd-Standing-FL.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guitar_3.png"]}]'::jsonb);
