anation":"Chameleon: 0.3 m (reference overall length). Nintendo Switch: 0.239 m (width with Joy-Con). Ratio: 1.26×.\nA 30 cm reference specimen including the tail. Chameleon species vary widely.\nOriginal Nintendo Switch: 239 mm wide with Joy-Con attached.","sources":["https://animals.sandiegozoo.org/animals/chameleon","https://www.nintendo.com/us/gaming-systems/switch/tech-specs/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ChameleonCutOut.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo-Switch-wJoyCons-BlRd-Standing-FL.png"]}]'::jsonb);
