mputer width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.5,"explanation":"Climbing hammer: 0.3 m (reference overall length). Atari Portfolio: 0.2 m (computer width). Ratio: 1.50×.\nA 30 cm hand-tool reference.\nThe pocket computer is about 20 cm wide.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Climbing_hammer.png","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atari_Portfolio","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Climbing_hammer.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Atari-Portfolio-Computer.png"]}]'::jsonb);
