":"iPhone 3G: 0.1155 m (phone height). Ledlenser T7M flashlight: 0.131 m (overall length). Ratio: 0.88×.\niPhone 3G height: 115.5 mm.\nT7M overall length: 131 mm.","sources":["https://devimages.apple.com/programs/ipod/dimensions/iPhone-3G-dimensions.pdf","https://www.ledlenser.my/product/flashlights/t7m/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:IPhone_3G.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:LED_LENSER_T7M_LED_flashlight.png"]}]'::jsonb);
