 cm · reference end-to-end length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.70714286,"explanation":"Size-7 basketball: 0.239 m (nominal diameter). Small scissors: 0.14 m (reference end-to-end length). Ratio: 1.71×.\nA nominal diameter of 23.9 cm, corresponding to about 75 cm circumference.\nA 14 cm household-scissors reference, measured from handle end to blade tip.","sources":["https://www.fiba.basketball/en/official-basketball-rules","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_pair_of_blue_scissors.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Isolated_basketball.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_pair_of_blue_scissors.png"]}]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO ledger_private.trivia_packs(game,slot,version,questions) VALUES('how-much-ish',167,7,'[{"id":"photo-size-v7-936","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the wire stripper to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Wire stripper","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:wire-stripper"},"reference":{"name":"Land tortoise","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:tortoise","measure":"30 cm · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.56666667,"explanation":"Wire stripper: 0.17 m (reference overall length). Land tortoise: 0.3 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 0.57×.\nA 17 cm hand-tool reference. The photograph supplies the outline, not a scale calibration.\nA 30 cm overall-length reference including the head and legs. Species and poses vary.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wire_stripper.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Tortoise.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wire_stripper.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Tortoise.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-937","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the three-cup moka pot to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Three-cup moka pot","dimension":"reference height","shape":"photo:coffee-pot"},"reference":{"name":"Game Boy Advance SP","dimension":"console width","shape":"photo:gba-sp","measure":"8.46 cm · console width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":1.89125296,"explanation":"Three-cup moka pot: 0.16 m (reference height). Game Boy Advance SP: 0.0846 m (console width). Ratio: 1.89×.\nA roughly 16 cm three-cup reference. Moka pots are sold in many capacities.\nThe SP is 84.6 mm wide, whether open or closed.","sources":["https://www.bialetti.com/ee_en/moka-express.html","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Game_Boy_Advance_SP","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Moka_Express_sideview.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Game-Boy-Advance