:guitar"},"reference":{"name":"Honda S2000","dimension":"vehicle length","shape":"photo:honda-s2000","measure":"4.135 m · vehicle length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.24183797,"explanation":"Full-size electric guitar: 1 m (reference overall length). Honda S2000: 4.135 m (vehicle length). Ratio: 0.24×.\nA one-metre reference guitar. Overall length varies by model; this is not its string scale length.\n2005 S2000 overall length: 4.135 m.","sources":["https://www.fender.com/articles/instruments/what-is-scale-length","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honda_S2000","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guitar_3.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:HondaS2000-004.png"]}]'::jsonb);
