sole width","shape":"photo:sega-nomad"},"reference":{"name":"Kick scooter","dimension":"reference handlebar height","shape":"photo:skateboard","measure":"1 m · reference handlebar height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":0.185,"explanation":"Sega Nomad: 0.185 m (console width). Kick scooter: 1 m (reference handlebar height). Ratio: 0.18×.\nThe Nomad is approximately 18.5 cm wide.\nA one-metre handlebar-height reference. Adjustable scooters can be set lower.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genesis_Nomad","https://www.stigasports.com/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sega-Nomad-Front_(rotated).png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stiga_Route_200_S.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-944","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the european badger to match its real size.","target":{"name":"European badger","dimension":"reference head-and-body length","shape":"photo:badger"},"reference":{"name":"Game Boy Color","dimension":"console height","shape":"photo:gameboy-color","measure":"13.35 cm · console height"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":5.61797753,"explanation":"European badger: 0.75 m (reference head-and-body length). Game Boy Color: 0.1335 m (console height). Ratio: 5.62×.\nA 75 cm adult reference, excluding the tail. Adults vary in size.\nThe Game Boy Color is 133.5 mm high.","sources":["https://www.woodlandtrust.org.uk/trees-woods-and-wildlife/animals/mammals/badger/","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Game_Boy_Color","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Badger.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nintendo-Game-Boy-Color-FL.png"]},{"id":"photo-size-v7-945","version":7,"kind":"scale","prompt":"Resize the full-size violin to match its real size.","target":{"name":"Full-size violin","dimension":"typical overall length","shape":"photo:violin"},"reference":{"name":"Sony a5000","dimension":"camera body width","shape":"photo:sony-camera","measure":"10.96 cm · camera body width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":5.38321168,"explanation":"Full-size violin: 0.59 m (typical overall length). Sony a5000: 0.1096 m (camera body width). Ratio: 5.38×.\nA full-size violin is about 59 cm overall. The bow is excluded.\nSony a5000 body width: 109.6 mm.","sources":["https://www.yamaha.com/en/musical_instrument_guide/violin/structure/","https://www.sony.com/electronics/interchangeable-lens-cameras/ilce-5000-kit/specifications","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Violin_VL100_(cropped).png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sony_A5000_white.png"]}]'::jsonb);
