pot: 0.16 m (reference height). Billiard chalk cube: 0.025 m (reference cube width). Ratio: 6.40×.\nA roughly 16 cm three-cup reference. Moka pots are sold in many capacities.\nA 2.5 cm chalk-cube reference.","sources":["https://www.bialetti.com/ee_en/moka-express.html","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Billiard_chalk_20050724.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Moka_Express_sideview.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Billiard_chalk_20050724.png"]}]'::jsonb);
