nikon-d90","measure":"13.2 cm · camera body width"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":6.81818182,"explanation":"F tuba: 0.9 m (reference standing height). Nikon D90: 0.132 m (camera body width). Ratio: 6.82×.\nA 90 cm standing-height reference. Tubas vary substantially by pitch and design.\nD90 body width: 132 mm. Lens and strap are not part of the width measurement.","sources":["https://www.yamaha.com/en/musical_instrument_guide/tuba/structure/","https://www.nikon.com/company/news/2008/0827_d90_01/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Viennese_six-valve_bass_tuba_in_F(made_by_Jungwirth)_Transparent.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nikon_D90.png"]}]'::jsonb);
