d"},"reference":{"name":"Small scissors","dimension":"reference end-to-end length","shape":"photo:scissors","measure":"14 cm · reference end-to-end length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":3.07142857,"explanation":"Commodore 128: 0.43 m (keyboard-computer width). Small scissors: 0.14 m (reference end-to-end length). Ratio: 3.07×.\nA 43 cm wide keyboard-computer reference.\nA 14 cm household-scissors reference, measured from handle end to blade tip.","sources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commodore_128","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_pair_of_blue_scissors.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Commodore-128.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Small_pair_of_blue_scissors.png"]}]'::jsonb);
