remote control","dimension":"reference overall length","shape":"photo:remote","measure":"14.5 cm · reference overall length"},"bounds":[0.02,50],"answer":5.17241379,"explanation":"European badger: 0.75 m (reference head-and-body length). Media remote control: 0.145 m (reference overall length). Ratio: 5.17×.\nA 75 cm adult reference, excluding the tail. Adults vary in size.\nA 14.5 cm reference remote, measured end to end.","sources":["https://www.woodlandtrust.org.uk/trees-woods-and-wildlife/animals/mammals/badger/","https://www.playstation.com/en-us/accessories/media-remote/","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Animals_png_set_by_mossi889-d4uye4q_-_Badger.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PlayStation_5_Media_Remote_-_front.png"]}]'::jsonb);
