ew length). Seven-spot ladybird: 0.007 m (reference body length). Ratio: 5.00×.\nA 35 mm drywall-screw reference; this is one selected size, not a universal screw length.\nA 7 mm adult reference, excluding legs and antennae.","sources":["https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Drywall_screw.png","https://www.wildlifetrusts.org/wildlife-explorer/invertebrates/beetles/7-spot-ladybird","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Drywall_screw.png","https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coccinella-septempunctata--Trp-1.png"]}]'::jsonb);
